{"1833170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vie: Try Again", "steam_appid": 1833170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her evil brother takes over her temples in a ploy to rise to greater power, the Moon Goddess-- Vie-- enlists the help of a lowly town guardsman named Cut in order to take back her territory, stop her brother, and <strong>save the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Join Cut As He:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dies repeatedly to monsters twice (or even half) his size. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builds a unique book of spells with the Goddess's divine power. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deals with narcissistic, condescending deities guarding the stolen temples. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades his stats and spells while fighting towards the next boss! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gets tired of dying repeatedly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tries again. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features Include:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck-building your personal spell book. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated maps and routes on each run, and the push to do it all over again when you fail. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Breathtaking</i> pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighthearted and humorous dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wacky encounters with a completely self-absorbed pantheon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <i>original, <strong>adaptive</strong> soundtrack</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about saving the world, and yourself. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her evil brother takes over her temples in a ploy to rise to greater power, the Moon Goddess-- Vie-- enlists the help of a lowly town guardsman named Cut in order to take back her territory, stop her brother, and <strong>save the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Join Cut As He:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dies repeatedly to monsters twice (or even half) his size. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builds a unique book of spells with the Goddess's divine power. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deals with narcissistic, condescending deities guarding the stolen temples. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades his stats and spells while fighting towards the next boss! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gets tired of dying repeatedly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tries again. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features Include:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck-building your personal spell book. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated maps and routes on each run, and the push to do it all over again when you fail. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Breathtaking</i> pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighthearted and humorous dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wacky encounters with a completely self-absorbed pantheon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <i>original, <strong>adaptive</strong> soundtrack</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about saving the world, and yourself. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "When her evil brother takes over her temples in a ploy to rise to greater power, the Moon Goddess-- Vie-- enlists the help of a lowly town guardsman named Cut in order to take back her territory, stop her brother, try again, and save the world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><stron